        "link": "https://thehill.com/homenews/campaign/5917340-platner-collins-maine-south-carolina-takeaways/",
        "orario": "06:14",
        "timestamp": 1781064840,
        "contenuto_esteso": "Progressive oyster farmer Graham Platner easily won the Democratic contest on Tuesday to take on Sen. Susan Collins (R-Maine) — officially teeing up one of this year's marquee Senate races. Planter was expected to win the Democratic primary, but recent revelations over a sexting scandal and his alleged toxic conduct from several ex-girlfriends have rocked his campaign and rattled..."
